{"id":"a34e887f1b6ba9e1","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-game3-subgame.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Subgame","display":"df-zfc-game3-subgame — ZFC Game3 Subgame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-subgame","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-subgame"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-subgame — ZFC Game3 Subgame","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-subgame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-subgame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-subgame — ZFC Game3 Subgame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,H\\in V\">\\(X,H\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(X\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> (move set and game tree of legal histories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in H\">\\(h\\in H\\)</span> (position at which the subgame starts)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_h\">\\(H_h\\)</span> (continuation tree defined by the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> (continuation history bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\)</span> (finite-sequence predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3Subgame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3Subgame}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3Subgame}_S(X,H,h,H_h)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land H\\subseteq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X)\\land t\\subseteq s\\to t\\in H\\bigr)\\land h\\in H\\land H_h=\\{\\ell\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(\\ell,X)\\land h^\\frown\\ell\\in H\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3Subgame}_S(X,H,h,H_h)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land H\\subseteq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X)\\land t\\subseteq s\\to t\\in H\\bigr)\\land h\\in H\\land H_h=\\{\\ell\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(\\ell,X)\\land h^\\frown\\ell\\in H\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The original legal-history set is explicitly required to be prefix closed before the continuation tree is formed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}$ (finite-sequence predicate; see [[58-df-finite-sequence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"H_h","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3Subgame}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3Subgame}_S(X,H,h,H_h)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land H\\subseteq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,X)\\land t\\subseteq s\\to t\\in H\\bigr)\\land h\\in H\\land H_h=\\{\\ell\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times X):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(\\ell,X)\\land h^\\frown\\ell\\in H\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1260,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-game3-subgame.md|58-df-zfc-game3-subgame]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f4bf86f66c1444da"]}